ca7da36922d396797ce96f68a54c9fa9f23557bbaec4f2b401b99214c50c3c7`)\n14\t- **Git Commits**:\n15\t  - Baseline REQ-MUSE-001: `9f87eb083545c0b6fdc5de0827ae50ae9b7c40b9` (`[agent] fix(muse-bridge): прунинг контекста Wonder 400k/320k/200k (REQ-MUSE-001, принятый базис)`)\n16\t  - Implementation REQ-MUSE-002/003/004: `4548dd30840e42fbba218f36cb0bb23ff81b660e` (`[agent] fix(muse-bridge): approval без рестарта хода, ретрай net-timeout, live reasoning (REQ-MUSE-002/003/004)`)\n17\t\n18\t## 2. Requirements & Architecture Decisions Traceability Matrix\n19\t| Requirement / AD | Exact Implementation in `bridges/muse-bridge/server.py` | Unit Tests in `tests/test_muse_bridge_killpg.py` | Status |\n20\t|---|---|---|---|\n21\t| `REQ-MUSE-002` / `AD-001`: approvalMode `allowAll` on `session/start` (env `denyUnmatched` support via `AD-007`); structured audit logging of auto-approved choices | `ApprovalPolicy`, `ServeRun.execute`, `_log_approval_decision` | `ApprovalTest` (22 tests, including `test_t_a01`, `test_t_a14`, `test_t_a10`) | PASS |\n22\t| `REQ-MUSE-002` / `AD-002`: Handle in-turn `approval/request` without `ServeUnavailable`/exec restart: return receipt `result={}`, then `approval/decide` with `choiceId` from `availableChoices`; `userInput/request` -> `userInput/cancel`; latch terminal denials; 15s cancel grace | `ApprovalPolicy.decide`, `ServeRun._handle_approval_request`, `ServeRun._handle_user_input_request`, terminal latch | `ApprovalTest`: `test_t_a02_approval_in_turn_decides_without_exec`, `test_t_a08_error_codes_latch`, `test_t_a09b_cancel_grace`, `test_t_a13_terminal_latch` | PASS |\n23\t| `REQ-MUSE-002` / `AD-006`: Server `-32030` ceiling: log warning, fallback to single exec pre-turn, no second `session/start` or decide | `ServeRun._handle_session_start_error` | `ApprovalTest.test_t_a11_ceiling_fallback` | PASS |\n24\t| `REQ-MUSE-003` / `AD-003`: Transient net-timeout retry loop in `Handler`: pre-action boundary (before first byte of `turn/start`), max 2 retries, 2s